Z||000001||sqoach||03-23-2001||09:48 PM||||looks like nobody has answered ya. well, i doubt painting the visors is an option. i've never personally painted cloth, but i don't think it will work very good. your best bet is to get new material and re-cover them. and i'm pretty sure i have some of those little trim screw covers. they are gray.<P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.JPG">  <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||1
