Z||000003||Songman||03-23-2001||10:56 PM||||Try a local upholstery shop and just get them re-covered. I had two of my cars done last year. They can get the correct material and everything. The local place I use charged me $10 per visor and it looked great! Painting or dyeing will never come out that good...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
